Package: crun
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: fast and lightweight OCI runtime written in C
 crun is a fast and low-memory-footprint OCI container runtime, fully
 written in C. It is the default runtime used by the podman-ubuntu stack.
